{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_39","type":"agent_message","text":"The focused regression tests and `go vet` both pass. The tests cover dispatcher shutdown and attempt release, but they don’t exercise a PID report larger than the reader’s limit; I’m proceeding with the required strict surface and validation checks, then I’ll check the conclusion draft against POSE."}}
