{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_52","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc '\"$POSE_REVIEW_CLI\" review bundle --help'","aggregated_output":"POSE - review\n\nGoverned review planning, bundle sealing, and attestation workflow\n\nUsage:\n  pose review bundle <scope|xref> [--seal] [--explain] [--expect-context <digest>]\n\nPrepare or seal an immutable review subject bundle\n\nExamples:\n  $ pose review bundle spec:my-feature --seal\n  $ pose review auto-attest spec:my-feature --apply\n  $ pose review verify spec:my-feature\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
